it is only natural that someone from the

00:18:06.292 --> 00:18:06.750
<i>The impulse of love (Get down!)</i>
Hajime fan club would go and gaze upon his face,

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:09.167
<i>I want to mess you up</i>
Hajime fan club would go and gaze upon his face,

00:18:09.167 --> 00:18:09.875
<i>I want to mess you up</i>
even if only for a moment.

