<i>Shake it love, YES!</i>
<i>      </i>

00:18:33.417 --> 00:18:35.042
We're home!

00:18:36.042 --> 00:18:37.750
Kurisu! Hina!

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:39.917
Tsubaki! Reina!

00:18:39.917 --> 00:18:42.917
Thank goodness. Jeez, where'd you guys go?

00:18:42.917 --> 00:18:47.042
We were all worried
since you disappeared suddenly.

00:18:47.042 --> 00:18:48.875
S-Sorry about that.

00:18:48.875 --> 00:18:50.667
I'm sorry!

00:18:50.667 --> 00:18:54.500
I'm sorry, too, but...
we got what we were after!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:55.833
Ta-da!

00:18:55.833 --> 00:18:57.333
Huh? That's--

00:18:57.333 --> 00:18:59.083
W-Where was it?

00:19:00.083 --> 00:19:05.417
It's a long story! We went on
a great, grand adventure!

00:19:05.417 --> 00:19:07.917
Ooh, a grand adventure! Lucky!

00:19:07.917 --> 00:19:09.833
I wanna hear more about it later!

00:19:09.833 --> 00:19:13.542
In any case, now we can turn back.

00:19:13.542 --> 00:19:15.625
Good job, all four of you.

00:19:19.708 --> 00:19:22.000
Tsukiusas, there's puddin--

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.292
Huh?

00:19:38.625 --> 00:19:41.208
Oh, good! We're completely back!

00:19:41.208 --> 00:19:43.000
And there are... no ears!

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:45.542
We managed to get back before curfew, too.

00:19:45.542 --> 00:19:47.292
This is no good at all!

00:19:47.292 --> 00:19:50.000
Why do <i>I </i>have to be scolded?

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.583
What do you mean, "why"?

00:19:51.583 --> 00:19:55.125
This whole mess was you and Matsuri's fault.

00:19:55.125 --> 00:19:57.500
I think it's only natural.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.708
In fact, you should be glad
you're getting away with just a scolding!

00:20:03.042 --> 00:20:05.583
But, Rui was really nice, wasn't he?

00:20:05.583 --> 00:20:10.125
Yeah, he was kind and cool! Right, Kurisu?

00:20:10.125 --> 00:20:15.708
Huh? I-I guess. He was
more reliable than I expected.

00:20:15.708 --> 00:20:19.875
Oh, do you all understand his charm, too?

00:20:19.875 --> 00:20:23.500
It makes me really happy to hear,
since we share the same month.

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:27.042
Rui's easily misunderstood.

00:20:30.208 --> 00:20:33.667
He was hiding an unexpected passion.

00:20:33.667 --> 00:20:36.750
I wonder what Rui's dream is...?

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.833
I hope it comes true!

00:20:38.833 --> 00:20:40.000
Yes.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:46.708
Well, he helped the future goddess, Kurisu Hijiri,
so he will receive blessings for that!

00:20:48.542 --> 00:20:52.625
Oh, I know! When we become goddesses,

00:20:52.625 --> 00:20:57.250
let's watch over Rui's dream
from the shadows and cheer him on!

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.500
Good idea.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:00.958
Well, I'm not against that.

00:21:00.958 --> 00:21:03.417
That's a wonderful idea, Reina!

00:21:04.375 --> 00:21:06.542
Everyone's excited, huh?

00:21:06.542 --> 00:21:10.625
After going through trouble together,
their bond is stronger, isn't it?

00:21:10.625 --> 00:21:12.833
I wonder what in the world happened...

00:21:12.833 --> 00:21:15.292
They said something about a grand adventure...

00:21:15.292 --> 00:21:20.167
I don't know the details, but I'm sure
it was a wonderful adventure.

00:21:20.167 --> 00:21:24.667
Got it, everyone? For Rui's sake, too,
we definitely have to become goddesses!

00:21:24.667 --> 00:21:26.083
Yeah!

00:21:54.458 --> 00:22:00.500
<i>Calm seashore on a glistening moonlit night</i>

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:06.792
<i>Your image, standing still on the water's surface</i>

00:22:06.792 --> 00:22:09.875
<i>A voice like a prayer</i>

00:22:09.875 --> 00:22:12.958
<i>Telling a story</i>

00:22:12.958 --> 00:22:19.208
<i>The words given to me</i>

00:22:19.208 --> 00:22:24.208
<i>They fall deep to the bottom of the ocean</i>

00:22:24.208 --> 00:22:26.417
<i>These words</i>

00:22:26.417 --> 00:22:31.667
<i>Aiming for the depths of my heart</i>

00:22:31.667 --> 00:22:34.792
<i>These kind encouragements</i>

00:22:34.792 --> 00:22:37.833
<i>These words of sympathy</i>

00:22:37.833 --> 00:22:43.708
<i>Drop their anchors silently</i>

00:22:43.708 --> 00:22:47.167
<i>The words you dropped</i>

00:22:47.167 --> 00:22:50.458
<i>Shake the sea of my heart</i>

00:22:50.458 --> 00:22:52.125
<i>The ripples on the water</i>

00:22:52.125 --> 00:22:56.500
<i>Shine bright rainbows</i>

00:22:56.500 --> 00:22:57.042
<i>I, too,</i>

00:22:57.042 --> 00:22:59.583
<i>want to respond to you</i>

00:22:59.583 --> 00:23:02.833
<i>I will find the words</i>

00:23:02.833 --> 00:23:09.625
<i>Can you stay by my side until then?</i>

